---
// Ported verbatim from reference/home.html's <section class="about" id="about"
// data-astro-cid-oxgmilyn>. All copy cross-checked character-for-character
// against the live HTML (not retyped from AUDIT.md/the brief).
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="shell grid">
    <div class="lede">
      <p class="eyebrow gold">About</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Made for the bar,<br />not the shelf.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p data-reveal="0">
        Stirling has been family owned since 1993, and the formulation philosophy hasn't changed:
        pure cane sugar, real flavor concentration, no chemical finish. It's why most operators
        find they pour less Stirling per drink than what they were using before.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal="1">
        The lineup — cane sugar syrups, sugar-free syrups, gourmet sauces, frappe mixes, shakeable
        toppings, and tea concentrates — is built as one system, so flavors layer instead of
        fight. French vanilla into a cappuccino frappe. Peanut butter into a mocha. One bar, one
        supplier, no dead ends.
      </p>
      <p data-reveal="2">If a case doesn't meet spec, we replace it or credit it. No forms, no argument.</p>
      <div class="card" data-reveal="3">
        <h3 class="h3">Quality Guaranteed</h3>
        <p>
          Thirty-three years in, we've learned that operators don't switch suppliers over a
          catalog — they switch over who picks up the phone. Reorder, spec sheet, or problem: you
          get a person, same day.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding-block: clamp(64px, 9vw, 132px);
  }
  .grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px);
    display: grid;
  }
  .lede {
    position: sticky;
    top: 96px;
  }
  .gold {
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .body {
    gap: 24px;
    display: grid;
  }
  .body > p {
    color: var(--body-on-cream);
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }
  .card {
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    background: var(--plum);
    color: #fff;
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 34px;
  }
  .card p {
    color: var(--on-dark);
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  @media (width <= 900px) {
    .lede {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
